A Branded Soul	1917	{"Gladys Brockwell","Colin Chase"}	{"Drama","Silent"}	A Branded Soul is a lost 1917 American silent drama film directed by Bertram Bracken and starring Gladys Brockwell. It was produced and distributed by the Fox Film Corporation.
The Bride of Hate	1917	{"Frank Keenan","Margery Wilson","Jerome Storm"}	{"Drama","Silent","War"}	The Bride of Hate is a 1917 American silent drama film directed by Walter Edwards and starring Frank Keenan, Margery Wilson, and Jerome Storm.
