The Little Orphan	1917	{"Ella Hall","Gertrude Astor","Gretchen Lederer"}	{"Drama","Silent"}	The Little Orphan is a 1917 American silent drama film directed by Jack Conway and starring Ella Hall, Gertrude Astor and Gretchen Lederer. Prints and/or fragments were found in the Dawson Film Find in 1978.
