Madame Sherry	1917	{"Gertrude McCoy","Frank O'Connor","Jean Stuart"}	{"Comedy","Silent"}	Madame Sherry is a 1917 American silent comedy film directed by Ralph Dean and starring Gertrude McCoy, Frank O'Connor and Jean Stuart. It is based on the 1910 musical play of the same title.
