The Tenth Case	1917	{"June Elvidge","John Bowers","George MacQuarrie"}	{"Drama","Silent"}	The Tenth Case is a 1917 American silent drama film directed by George Kelson and starring June Elvidge, John Bowers and George MacQuarrie.
