The Undying Flame	1917	{"Olga Petrova","Mahlon Hamilton"}	{"Drama","Silent"}	The Undying Flame is a lost 1917 silent film drama directed by Maurice Tourneur, produced by Jesse Lasky and released by Paramount Pictures. This movie starred Olga Petrova, an English-born actress who became popular in silents playing vamps.
The Unforseen	1917	{"Olive Tell","David Powell"}	{"Drama","Silent"}	The Unforseen is a lost 1917 silent film drama directed by John B. O'Brien and starring Olive Tell and David Powell. It was distributed through the Mutual Film Company. It is based on a 1903 Broadway play, The Unforeseen(spelling of play varies from the film), by Robert Marshall.
Until They Get Me	1917	{"Pauline Starke","Jack Curtis"}	{"Drama","Western"}	Until They Get Me is a 1917 American Western drama film directed by Frank Borzage. The film is in the public domain in the United States today due to copyright expiration.
