The Waiting Soul	1917	{"Olga Petrova","Mahlon Hamilton","Mathilde Brundage"}	{"Drama","Silent"}	The Waiting Soul is a 1917 American silent drama film directed by Burton L. King and starring Olga Petrova, Mahlon Hamilton and Mathilde Brundage.
