Go West, Young Man	1918	{"Tom Moore","Ora Carew","Jack Richardson"}	{"Western","Comedy","Silent"}	Go West, Young Man is a 1918 American silent comedy Western film directed by Harry Beaumont and starring Tom Moore, Ora Carew and Melbourne MacDowell.
The Goat	1918	{"Fred Stone","Fanny Midgley","Rhea Mitchell"}	{"Comedy","Silent"}	The Goat is a 1918 American silent comedy film directed by Donald Crisp and written by Frances Marion. The film stars Fred Stone, Fanny Midgley, Charles McHugh, Rhea Mitchell, Sylvia Ashton, Philo McCullough, and Winifred Greenwood. The film was released on September 29, 1918, by Paramount Pictures.
