The Hun Within	1918	{"Dorothy Gish","George Fawcett","Charles K. Gerrard"}	{"War","Drama","Silent","Thriller"}	The Hun Within is a 1918 American silent war drama thriller film directed by Chester Withey and starring Dorothy Gish and George Fawcett. It was written by historic Biograph directors D. W. Griffith and Stanner E. V. Taylor.
