In the Hollow of Her Hand	1918	{"Alice Brady","Percy Marmont","Myrtle Stedman"}	{"Mystery","Drama","Silent"}	In the Hollow of Her Hand is a lost 1918 American silent mystery drama film directed by Charles Maigne and starring Alice Brady. It was produced and distributed by the Select Pictures Corporation.
