Fruits of Passion	1919	{"Alice Mann","Donald Hall"}	{"Drama","Silent"}	Fruits of Passion is a 1919 American silent drama film directed by George Ridgwell and starring Alice Mann and Donald Hall. Location shooting took place in the Adirondack Mountains.
A Fugitive from Matrimony	1919	{"H. B. Warner","Seena Owen"}	{"Comedy","Silent"}	A Fugitive from Matrimony is a 1919 American silent comedy film directed by Henry King and starring H.B. Warner, Seena Owen, and Adele Farrington.
