The Fatal Hour	1920	{"Wilfred Lytell","Lionel Pape"}	{"Drama","Silent"}	The Fatal Hour is a lost 1920 American feature-length silent film directed by George W. Terwilliger. It starred Broadway star Thomas W. Ross (1873–1959) and Wilfred Lytell, and was released by Metro Pictures.
