Felix O'Day	1920	{"H. B. Warner","Marguerite Snow","Lillian Rich"}	{"Drama","Silent"}	Felix O'Day is a lost 1920 silent film directed by Robert Thornby and starring H. B. Warner. The film was released through Pathé Exchange. It is based on a novel of the same name.
