The Flaming Clue	1920	{"Harry T. Morey","Lucy Fox"}	{"Crime","Drama","Silent"}	The Flaming Clue is a 1920 American silent drama film directed by Edwin L. Hollywood and written by William B. Courtney and Frederic Van Rensselaer Dey. The film stars Harry T. Morey, Lucy Fox, and Sidney Dalbrook.
