Cupid's Brand	1921	{"Jack Hoxie","Wilbur McGaugh","Mignon Anderson"}	{"Western","Silent"}	Cupid's Brand is a 1921 American silent Western film directed by Rowland V. Lee and starring Jack Hoxie, Wilbur McGaugh and Mignon Anderson.
Cyclone Bliss	1921	{"Jack Hoxie","Evelyn Nelson","Fred Kohler"}	{"Western","Silent"}	Cyclone Bliss is a 1921 American silent Western film directed by Francis Ford and starring Jack Hoxie, Evelyn Nelson and Fred Kohler.
Danger Ahead	1921	{"Mary Philbin","James W. Morrison","Jack Mower"}	{"Drama","Silent","Romance"}	Danger Ahead is a lost 1921 American silent romantic drama film directed by Rollin S. Sturgeon and starring Mary Philbin, still a teenager. It was based on a story The Harbour Road by Sara Ware Bassett. Universal Film Manufacturing Company produced and distributed the picture.
Dangerous Curve Ahead	1921	{"Helene Chadwick","Richard Dix","Maurice 'Lefty' Flynn"}	{"Comedy","Silent"}	Dangerous Curve Ahead is a 1921 American silent comedy starring Helene Chadwick and Richard Dix. The film is considered to be lost.
