The Grim Comedian	1921	{"Jack Holt","Gloria Hope","Laura La Varnie"}	{"Drama","Silent"}	The Grim Comedian is a 1921 American silent drama film directed by Frank Lloyd and starring Phoebe Hunt, Jack Holt, and Gloria Hope.
Guile of Women	1921	{"Will Rogers","Bert Sprotte","Mary Warren"}	{"Comedy","Silent"}	Guile of Women is a 1921 American silent comedy film directed by Clarence G. Badger and written by Edfrid A. Bingham. The film stars Will Rogers, Mary Warren, Bert Sprotte, Lionel Belmore, Charles Smiley, and Nick Cogley. The film was released on January 1, 1921, by Goldwyn Pictures.
