The Land of Hope	1921	{"Alice Brady","Jason Robards Sr.","Larry Wheat"}	{"Drama"}	The Land of Hope is a lost 1921 American drama film directed by Edward H. Griffith and written by Fred Myton. The film stars Alice Brady, Jason Robards Sr., Ben Hendricks Jr., Schuyler Ladd, Larry Wheat, and Martha McGraw. The film was released in July 1921, by Realart Pictures Corporation.
The Last Card	1921	{"May Allison","Alan Roscoe","Irene Hunt"}	{"Drama","Silent","Romance"}	The Last Card is an extant 1921 silent romantic drama film directed by Bayard Veiller and starring May Allison. It was produced and distributed by Metro Pictures to poor audience reception.
