A Perfect Crime	1921	{"Monte Blue","Jacqueline Logan","Carole Lombard"}	{"Comedy","Drama","Silent"}	A Perfect Crime is a 1921 American silent comedy-drama film directed by Allan Dwan and starring Monte Blue, Jacqueline Logan, and Stanton Heck. It is not known whether the film survives which suggests it may be lost.
Penny of Top Hill Trail	1921	{"Bessie Love","Wheeler Oakman","Raymond Cannon"}	{"Comedy","Drama","Silent","Western"}	Penny of Top Hill Trail is a 1921 American silent Western comedy film based on the 1919 novel by Belle Kanaris Maniates. It was directed by Arthur Berthelet and stars Bessie Love. The film was produced by Andrew J. Callaghan Productions and distributed by Federated Film Exchanges of America. The film is presumed lost.
Pilgrims of the Night	1921	{"Lewis Stone","Rubye De Remer","William V. Mong"}	{"Drama","War"}	Pilgrims of the Night is a 1921 American drama film directed by Edward Sloman and starring Lewis Stone, Rubye De Remer and William V. Mong. It is based on the 1910 novel Passers-By by the British writer E. Phillips Oppenheim.
