Back to Yellow Jacket	1922	{"Roy Stewart","Kathleen Kirkham","Earl Metcalfe"}	{"Western","Silent"}	Back to Yellow Jacket is a 1922 American silent Western film directed by Ben F. Wilson and starring Roy Stewart, Kathleen Kirkham and Earl Metcalfe.
