Bell Boy 13	1923	{"Douglas MacLean","John Steppling"}	{"Comedy","Silent"}	Bell Boy 13 is a 1923 American silent comedy film directed by William A. Seiter, and starring Douglas MacLean, John Steppling, Margaret Loomis, William Courtright, Emily Gerdes, and Eugene Burr. The film was released by First National Pictures on January 19, 1923.
