Daytime Wives	1923	{"Wyndham Standing","Grace Darmond"}	{"Drama"}	Daytime Wives is a 1923 American drama film directed by Émile Chautard, and written by Helmer Walton Bergman and Wyndham Gittens. The film stars Derelys Perdue, Wyndham Standing, Grace Darmond, William Conklin, Guy Edward Hearn, and Katherine Lewis. The film was released on September 2, 1923, by Film Booking Offices of America.
