The Destroying Angel	1923	{"Leah Baird","John Bowers"}	{"Romance","Comedy","Silent"}	The Destroying Angel is a 1923 American silent comedy film directed by W.S. Van Dyke and starring Leah Baird, John Bowers and Noah Beery.
