The Man Next Door	1923	{"David Torrence","Alice Calhoun"}	{"Comedy","Drama","Silent"}	The Man Next Door is a 1923 American silent comedy-drama film directed by Victor Schertzinger and starring David Torrence, Frank Sheridan, and James W. Morrison.
A Man of Action	1923	{"Marguerite De La Motte","Raymond Hatton"}	{"Crime","Comedy"}	A Man of Action is a 1923 American comedy film directed by James W. Horne and written by Bradley King. The film stars Douglas MacLean, Marguerite De La Motte, Raymond Hatton, Wade Boteler, Arthur Millett, and Kingsley Benedict. The film was released on June 3, 1923, by Associated First National Pictures.
The Man Who Won	1923	{"Dustin Farnum","Jacqueline Gadsden"}	{"Drama","Silent","Western"}	The Man Who Won is a 1923 American silent Western film directed by William A. Wellman. It was produced and distributed by the Fox Film Corporation. It is now a lost film.
Man's Size	1923	{"William Russell","Alma Bennett"}	{"Western","Drama","Silent"}	Man's Size is a 1923 American silent drama film directed by Howard M. Mitchell and starring William Russell, Alma Bennett, and Stanton Heck. It is based upon the novel Man Size by William MacLeod Raine.
