A Thief in Paradise	1925	{"Doris Kenyon","Ronald Colman","Aileen Pringle"}	{"Drama","Silent"}	A Thief in Paradise is a 1925 American silent drama film produced by Samuel Goldwyn, directed by George Fitzmaurice, and adapted by Frances Marion from Leonard Merrick's 1900 novel The Worldlings.
