West of Mojave	1925	{"Gordon Clifford","Charlotte Pierce"}	{"Western","Silent"}	West of Mojave is a 1925 American silent Western film directed by Harry L. Fraser and starring Gordon Clifford, Charlotte Pierce and Frank Lackteen.
