The Wheel	1925	{"Margaret Livingston","Harrison Ford"}	{"Drama","Silent"}	The Wheel is a 1925 American silent drama film directed by Victor Schertzinger and starring Margaret Livingston, Harrison Ford, and Claire Adams.
