Oh, What a Night!	1926	{"Raymond McKee","Edna Murphy","Charles K. French"}	{"Comedy","Silent"}	Oh, What a Night! is a 1926 American silent comedy film directed by Lloyd Ingraham and starring Raymond McKee,Edna Murphy and Charles K. French.
