Times Square Playboy	1936	{"Gene Lockhart","Warren William","June Travis"}	{"Comedy","Romance"}	Times Square Playboy is a 1936 American romance film directed by William C. McGann and starring Warren William, June Travis and Barton MacLane. It is also known by the alternative title of His Best Man. The film's art direction was by Esdras Hartley, its costume design by Orry-Kelly.
