Trapped by Television	1936	{"Mary Astor","Lyle Talbot","Joyce Compton"}	{"Drama","Comedy","Crime","Science Fiction"}	Trapped by Television is a 1936 American comedy-drama crime science fiction film directed by Del Lord and starring Mary Astor, Lyle Talbot and Nat Pendleton. The film is also known as Caught by Television in the United Kingdom.
