The Phantom Thief	1946	{"Chester Morris","Jeff Donnell"}	{"Mystery","Crime"}	The Phantom Thief is a 1946 American crime film directed by D. Ross Lederman. The film follows detective Boston Blackie as he tries to track down a blackmailer-murderer. As the investigation goes on, a supernatural element becomes clear.
