The Return of Rusty	1946	{"John Litel","Barbara Woodell"}	{"Drama"}	The Return of Rusty is a 1946 American drama film directed by William Castle and starring Ted Donaldson, John Litel and Mark Dennis. It was the second in the eight part Rusty film series produced by Columbia Pictures.
