Stallion Road	1947	{"Ronald Reagan","Alexis Smith","Zachary Scott"}	{"Drama","Western"}	Stallion Road is a 1947 American Drama Western film directed by James V. Kern, written by Stephen Longstreet, and starring Ronald Reagan, Alexis Smith, Zachary Scott, Peggy Knudsen, Patti Brady and Harry Davenport. It was released by Warner Bros. on April 12, 1947.
