Rebel Rabbit	1949	{"Bugs Bunny"}	{"Animated"}	Rebel Rabbit is a 1949 Warner Bros. Merrie Melodies animated short. The cartoon was released on April 9, 1949, and features Bugs Bunny.
Technicolor for Industrial Films	1949	{}	{}	Technicolor for Industrial Films (1949) is a sponsored film about how Technicolor can be used in industrial films. The film features footage of various objects in Technicolor, showing how it can be used in filmmaking. One scene shows a bunch of everyday goods, first being shown in black-and-white, then in Technicolor.
