711 Ocean Drive	1950	{"Edmond O'Brien","Joanne Dru","Dorothy Patrick"}	{"Crime","Drama","Noir"}	711 Ocean Drive is a 1950 American crime film noir directed by Joseph M. Newman and starring Edmond O'Brien, Joanne Dru and Otto Kruger.
Abbott and Costello in the Foreign Legion	1950	{"Abbott and Costello","Patricia Medina"}	{"Comedy"}	Abbott and Costello in the Foreign Legion is a black and white 1950 American comedy film directed by Charles Lamont and starring the comedy team of Abbott and Costello.
