Nevada Badmen	1951	{"Whip Wilson","Phyllis Coates"}	{"Western"}	Nevada Badmen is a 1951 American Western film directed by Lewis D. Collins and written by Joseph O'Donnell. The film stars Whip Wilson, Fuzzy Knight, Jim Bannon, I. Stanford Jolley, Phyllis Coates and Marshall Reed. The film was released on May 27, 1951, by Monogram Pictures.
