The Swinging Cheerleaders	1974	{"Rainbeaux Smith","Colleen Camp","Rosanne Katon"}	{"Comedy","Drama"}	The Swinging Cheerleaders is a 1974 comedy-drama film written and directed by exploitation film auteur Jack Hill.
