Young Guns II	1990	{"Emilio Estevez","Kiefer Sutherland","Lou Diamond Phillips","Christian Slater","William Petersen"}	{"Western","Action"}	Young Guns II is a 1990 American Western action film and a sequel to Young Guns (1988). It stars Emilio Estevez, Kiefer Sutherland, Lou Diamond Phillips, and Christian Slater, and features William Petersen as Pat Garrett. It was written by John Fusco and directed by Geoff Murphy.
