Bulletproof	1996	{"Damon Wayans","Adam Sandler","James Caan","James Farentino","Kristen Wilson"}	{"Action","Comedy"}	Bulletproof is a 1996 American buddy cop action comedy film directed by Ernest Dickerson and starring Damon Wayans and Adam Sandler.
