The Lawnmower Man 2: Beyond Cyberspace	1996	{"Patrick Bergin","Matt Frewer","Austin O'Brien"}	{"Science Fiction","Action"}	Lawnmower Man 2: Beyond Cyberspace is a 1996 American science fiction action film written and directed by Farhad Mann, and starring Matt Frewer, Patrick Bergin, Austin O'Brien, and Ely Pouget. It is a sequel to the 1992 film The Lawnmower Man. The film was negatively reviewed by both critics and fans of the original film.
Listen	1996	{"Brooke Langton","Sarah G. Buxton"}	{"Thriller","Mystery"}	Listen is a 1996 American mystery thriller film directed by Gavin Wilding, starring Brooke Langton, Sarah G. Buxton, Gordon Currie, Andy Romano, J. H. Wyman.
The Little Riders	1996	{"Paul Scofield","Malcolm McDowell","Noley Thornton"}	{"Drama"}	The Little Riders is a book by Margaretha Shemin, that was made into a television movie in 1996 which aired on the Disney Channel. It tells the story of Joanna Hunter, a young Dutch-American girl who goes to visit her grandparents in the Netherlands, when the Nazis occupy the village. Joanna must protect the statues in the town's clock tower of the freedom fighters who defended the village, when the Nazis threaten to destroy them.
