Paranoid Park	2008	{"Gabe Nevins","Taylor Momsen","Jake Miller","Daniel Liu","Lauren McKinney","Scott Patrick Green"}	{"Drama","Teen"}	Paranoid Park is a 2007 coming of age teen drama film written and directed by Gus Van Sant. The film is based on the novel of the same name by Blake Nelson and takes place in Portland, Oregon. It's the story of a teenage skateboarder set against the backdrop of a police investigation into a mysterious death.
