Play the Game	2009	{"Andy Griffith","Paul Campbell","Liz Sheridan","Doris Roberts","Marla Sokoloff"}	{"Comedy","Romance"}	Play the Game is a 2009 romantic comedy film starring Andy Griffith, Paul Campbell, Liz Sheridan, Doris Roberts, and Marla Sokoloff, written and directed by Marc Fienberg. This was Andy Griffith's last film credit; he died on July 3, 2012. The film received attention for containing a sex scene between Sheridan and Griffith.
