X Games: The Movie	2009	{"Shaun White","Travis Pastrana","Ricky Carmichael","Danny Way","Bob Burnquist"}	{"Action","Sports","Documentary"}	X Games 3D: The Movie is an action sports/documentary 3-D film released on August 21, 2009, for one week only. Produced by ESPN Films and distributed by Walt Disney Studios Motion Pictures, the film captures the drama and spectacle that plays out every year at the X Games, highlighting the behind-the-scenes stories of the featured athletes and the sacrifices they make in pursuit of glory and the advancement of their sports on the industry's biggest stage.
