We Live in Public	2009	{"Josh Harris"}	{"Documentary"}	WE LIVE IN PUBLIC is a 2009 documentary film by Ondi Timoner, which profiles Internet pioneer Josh Harris. Its theme is the loss of privacy in the Internet age.
