Comic-Con Episode IV: A Fan's Hope	2012	{"Skip Harvey","Eric Henson","Chuck Rozanski","James Darling","Se Young Kang"}	{"Documentary"}	Comic-Con Episode IV: A Fan's Hope is a 2011 documentary film on the San Diego Comic-Con International, directed by Morgan Spurlock.
