Darling Companion	2012	{"Kevin Kline","Diane Keaton","Richard Jenkins","Elisabeth Moss","Mark Duplass","Dianne Wiest","Sam Shepard"}	{"Comedy","Drama"}	Darling Companion is a 2012 American comedy-drama film directed by Lawrence Kasdan, written by Kasdan and his wife Meg, and starring Diane Keaton and Kevin Kline. Filming took place in Utah in 2010 and was released on April 20, 2012.
