Fury	2012	{"Samuel L. Jackson","Luke Kirby","Ruth Negga","Tom Wilkinson"}	{"Crime","Drama"}	The Samaritan, known as Fury in the United Kingdom, is a 2012 crime drama film co-written and directed by David Weaver, and starring Samuel L. Jackson. A trailer was released on its website.
