Lovely Molly	2012	{"Gretchen Lodge","Johnny Lewis","Alexandra Holden","Lauren Lakis"}	{"Horror","Supernatural"}	Lovely Molly is a 2011 American supernatural horror film directed by Eduardo Sánchez. The film initially had a working title of The Possession but was later changed to Lovely Molly. The plot follows newlyweds Molly and Tim as they move into the bride's childhood home, where painful memories and a powerful demon soon begin to haunt Molly.
Mansome	2012	{"Will Arnett","Jason Bateman","Adam Carolla","Paul Rudd","Zach Galifianakis"}	{"Documentary"}	Mansome is a 2012 documentary film directed by Morgan Spurlock, and executive-produced by actors/comedians Will Arnett and Jason Bateman, and Electus founder Ben Silverman.
