Aftershock	2013	{"Eli Roth","Andrea Osvárt","Selena Gomez","Ariel Levy","Nicolas Martinez","Lorenza Izzo","Natasha Yarovenko"}	{"Disaster","Horror"}	Aftershock is a 2012 Chilean-American disaster horror film directed by Nicolás López and starring Eli Roth. It was written by López, Roth, and Guillermo Amoedo, from a story by Roth and López.
