Europa Report	2013	{"Sharlto Copley","Michael Nyqvist","Daniel Wu","Anamaria Marinca","Christian Camargo","Karolina Wydra","Embeth Davidtz","Dan Fogler"}	{"Science Fiction"}	Europa Report is a 2013 American science fiction film directed by Sebastián Cordero and written by Philip Gelatt. It stars Christian Camargo, Anamaria Marinca, Michael Nyqvist, Daniel Wu, Karolina Wydra, and Sharlto Copley. A found footage film, it recounts the fictional story of the first crewed mission to Europa, one of the four Galilean moons of Jupiter. Despite a disastrous technical failure that causes the loss of all communications with Earth, and a series of further crises, the crew continues its mission to Europa and finds mounting evidence of life on this Galilean moon of Jupiter.
