Kid Cannabis	2014	{"Jonathan Daniel Brown","Kenny Wormald","Aaron Yoo","Ron Perlman","John C. McGinley"}	{"Comedy","Drama","Biography"}	Kid Cannabis is a 2014 American biographical comedy-drama film. It is based on the true story of a teen named Nate Norman who dropped out out of highschool to build a multimillion-dollar marijuana ring by trafficking drugs with his friends through the woods across the US-Canada international border.
