The Mummy	2017	{"Tom Cruise","Russell Crowe","Sofia Boutella","Annabelle Wallis","Jake Johnson","Marwan Kenzari","Courtney B. Vance"}	{"Action","Adventure","Fantasy"}	The Mummy is a 2017 American action-adventure fantasy film directed by Alex Kurtzman and written by David Koepp, Christopher McQuarrie, and Dylan Kussman, with a story by Kurtzman, Jon Spaihts, and Jenny Lumet. A reboot of The Mummy franchise as part of Universal's scrapped Dark Universe series, it stars Tom Cruise as U.S. Army Sergeant Nick Morton, a soldier of fortune who accidentally unearths the ancient tomb of entrapped Egyptian princess Ahmanet. Annabelle Wallis, Jake Johnson, Courtney B. Vance, and Russell Crowe also star.
