The Only Living Boy in New York	2017	{"Callum Turner","Kate Beckinsale","Pierce Brosnan","Cynthia Nixon","Jeff Bridges"}	{"Drama"}	The Only Living Boy in New York is a 2017 American drama film directed by Marc Webb and written by Allan Loeb. The film stars Callum Turner, Kate Beckinsale, Pierce Brosnan, Cynthia Nixon, Kiersey Clemons, and Jeff Bridges. The film was released on August 11, 2017, by Roadside Attractions and Amazon Studios, receiving generally negative reviews.
