Cats & Dogs 3: Paws Unite!	2020	{"Melissa Rauch","Max Greenfield","George Lopez"}	{"Action","Comedy","Spy"}	Cats & Dogs 3: Paws Unite! is a 2020 American spy action comedy film, starring the voices of Melissa Rauch, Max Greenfield, and George Lopez. It is a stand-alone sequel to 2010's Cats & Dogs: The Revenge of Kitty Galore and the third and final film of the Cats & Dogs film series. Unlike the first two installments, Paws Unite! was released straight to video in the United States on September 15, 2020. It is also the only film that does not feature any cast members from the previous installments.
