Mainstream	2021	{"Andrew Garfield","Maya Hawke","Nat Wolff","Johnny Knoxville","Jason Schwartzman"}	{"Comedy","Drama"}	Mainstream is a 2020 American comedy-drama film directed by Gia Coppola, who co-wrote the screenplay with Tom Stuart. It stars Andrew Garfield, Maya Hawke, Nat Wolff, Johnny Knoxville and Jason Schwartzman.
The Water Man	2021	{"David Oyelowo","Rosario Dawson","Lonnie Chavis","Amiah Miller","Alfred Molina","Maria Bello"}	{"Drama"}	The Water Man is a 2020 American drama film directed by David Oyelowo, in his feature directorial debut, from a screenplay by Emma Needell. The film stars Oyelowo, Rosario Dawson, Lonnie Chavis, Amiah Miller, Alfred Molina and Maria Bello. Oprah Winfrey serves as an executive producer via her revived Harpo Films banner.
