Nightbooks	2021	{"Winslow Fegley","Lidya Jewett","Krysten Ritter"}	{"Fantasy"}	Nightbooks is a 2021 American dark fantasy film directed by David Yarovesky and written by Mikki Daughtry and Tobias Iaconis. It is based on the 2018 horror-fantasy children's book of the same name by J. A. White. The film stars Winslow Fegley, Lidya Jewett, and Krysten Ritter.
