Introducing, Selma Blair	2021	{"Selma Blair"}	{"Documentary"}	Introducing, Selma Blair is a 2021 American documentary film, directed by Rachel Fleit. It follows Selma Blair, adapting to new ways of living after revealing her multiple sclerosis diagnosis.
