Heart of Champions	2021	{"Michael Shannon","Alexander Ludwig","Charles Melton"}	{"Drama"}	Heart of Champions is a 2021 American drama film directed by Michael Mailer, from a screenplay by Vojin Gjaja. It stars Michael Shannon, Alexander Ludwig, Charles Melton, David James Elliott and Ash Santos.
