Swan Song	2021	{"Mahershala Ali","Naomie Harris","Glenn Close","Awkwafina","Adam Beach"}	{"Drama","Science Fiction","Romance"}	Swan Song is a 2021 American science fiction romantic drama film written and directed by Benjamin Cleary. The film stars Mahershala Ali, Naomie Harris, Awkwafina, Glenn Close, and Adam Beach.
The Tender Bar	2021	{"Ben Affleck","Tye Sheridan","Lily Rabe","Christopher Lloyd","Daniel Ranieri"}	{}	The Tender Bar is a 2021 American coming-of-age film directed by George Clooney from a screenplay by William Monahan. Adapted from the 2005 memoir of the same name by J. R. Moehringer, it recounts Moehringer's life growing up on Long Island. It stars Ben Affleck, Tye Sheridan, Daniel Ranieri, Lily Rabe, and Christopher Lloyd. It was the final film appearance of Sondra James before her death in September 2021.
