The 355	2022	{"Jessica Chastain","Lupita Nyong'o","Penélope Cruz","Diane Kruger","Fan Bingbing","Sebastian Stan","Édgar Ramírez"}	{"Action","Spy","Thriller"}	The 355 is a 2022 American action spy thriller film directed by Simon Kinberg from a screenplay by Theresa Rebeck and Kinberg, and a story by Rebeck. The film features an ensemble cast, starring Jessica Chastain, Penélope Cruz, Fan Bingbing, Diane Kruger, and Lupita Nyong'o as a group of international spies who must work together to stop a terrorist organization from starting World War III. Édgar Ramírez and Sebastian Stan also star. The title is derived from Agent 355, the codename of a female spy for the Patriots during the American Revolution.
